            <ArticleTitle>The cracked tooth syndrome: additional findings.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>971-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The results of this study add to the previous findings on the cracked tooth syndrome. Treatment to prevent further cracking is a must. Dentists should be aware of the syndrome and, after making the diagnosis, initiate necessary treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
